<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>IoC Results: DHS Emergency Directive 21-01 - SolarWinds - Method 2 v2</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[Learn more about this analysis online: <A href="https://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/2998627">https://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/2998627</A><BR><BR>Learn more about this analysis online: <A href="https://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/2998626">https://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/2998626</A><BR><BR>Learn more about this analysis online: <A href="https://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/2998621">https://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/2998621</A><BR><BR>
<P><A href="https://cyber.dhs.gov/ed/21-01/"><FONT color=#0066cc>https://cyber.dhs.gov/ed/21-01/</FONT></A></P>
<P>Parse scan results from&nbsp;BES Client\BPS-Scans\ED21-01</P>
<P><STRONG>v1.1: Additional sha256 hashes</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>v1.1: Additional sha256 hashes provided by </STRONG>&nbsp;<A href="https://msrc-blog.microsoft.com/2020/12/13/customer-guidance-on-recent-nation-state-cyber-attacks/">https://msrc-blog.microsoft.com/2020/12/13/customer-guidance-on-recent-nation-state-cyber-attacks/</A></P>
<P><STRONG>v1.2: FIx for native path inspection</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>v1.3: Fix for very old clients lacking 'locked line of file' inspector, and remove 3 erroneous hashes from the comparison list</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>v2: Add additional Microsoft hashes, add SuperNova detection</STRONG></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>Property List:</P>
<UL>
<LI>ED-21-01 - Scan Results Exist
<UL>
<LI>Notes whether the system has run a full-file scan</LI></UL>
<LI>ED-21-01 - Scan Completion Time
<UL>
<LI>The time at which the most recent scan completed</LI></UL>
<LI>ED-21-01 - Detected Results
<UL>
<LI>Any compromised files that were found by the scan.&nbsp; A result here indicates a potential compromise.</LI></UL>
<LI>ED-21-01 - All Target File Details
<UL>
<LI>Details on files targeted for scanning.&nbsp; This does not itself indicate a compromise, but is useful in comparing against rapidly-changing hash identification.</LI></UL></LI></UL>
<P><STRONG>Ref:</STRONG></P>
<P><A href="https://cyber.dhs.gov/ed/21-01/"><FONT color=#0066cc>https://cyber.dhs.gov/ed/21-01/</FONT></A></P>
<P><A href="https://msrc-blog.microsoft.com/2020/12/13/customer-guidance-on-recent-nation-state-cyber-attacks/">https://msrc-blog.microsoft.com/2020/12/13/customer-guidance-on-recent-nation-state-cyber-attacks/</A></P>
<P><A href="https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/solarstorm-supernova/">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/solarstorm-supernova/</A></P>
