    <Property ID="4" Name="ED-21-01 - Detected Results" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H">(if it as lowercase contains &quot;netsetupsvc.dll&quot; then concatenation &quot;|&quot; of (pathname of it; size of it as string; modification time of it as string; version of it as string | &quot;version not detected&quot;; md5 of it | &quot;md5 not detected&quot;; sha1 of it | &quot;sha1 not detected&quot;; sha256 of it | &quot;sha256 not detected&quot;) of files &quot;netsetupsvc.dll&quot; of system wow64 folder  else (if it contains &quot;SolarWinds.Orion.Core.BusinessLayer.dll&quot; and ( sha1 of it = &quot;76640508b1e7759e548771a5359eaed353bf1eec&quot;  OR sha256 of it is contained by set of (&quot;e0b9eda35f01c1540134aba9195e7e6393286dde3e001fce36fb661cc346b91d&quot; ;&quot;a58d02465e26bdd3a839fd90e4b317eece431d28cab203bbdde569e11247d9e2&quot; ;&quot;32519b85c0b422e4656de6e6c41878e95fd95026267daab4215ee59c107d6c77&quot; ;&quot;dab758bf98d9b36fa057a66cd0284737abf89857b73ca89280267ee7caf62f3b&quot; ;&quot;eb6fab5a2964c5817fb239a7a5079cabca0a00464fb3e07155f28b0a57a2c0ed&quot; ;&quot;c09040d35630d75dfef0f804f320f8b3d16a481071076918e9b236a321c1ea77&quot; ;&quot;ffdbdd460420972fd2926a7f460c198523480bc6279dd6cca177230db18748e8&quot; ;&quot;b8a05cc492f70ffa4adcd446b693d5aa2b71dc4fa2bf5022bf60d7b13884f666&quot; ;&quot;20e35055113dac104d2bb02d4e7e33413fae0e5a426e0eea0dfd2c1dce692fd9&quot; ;&quot;0f5d7e6dfdd62c83eb096ba193b5ae394001bac036745495674156ead6557589&quot; ;&quot;cc082d21b9e880ceb6c96db1c48a0375aaf06a5f444cb0144b70e01dc69048e6&quot; ;&quot;ac1b2b89e60707a20e9eb1ca480bc3410ead40643b386d624c5d21b47c02917c&quot; ;&quot;019085a76ba7126fff22770d71bd901c325fc68ac55aa743327984e89f4b0134&quot; ;&quot;ce77d116a074dab7a22a0fd4f2c1ab475f16eec42e1ded3c0b0aa8211fe858d6&quot; ;&quot;2b3445e42d64c85a5475bdbc88a50ba8c013febb53ea97119a11604b7595e53d&quot; ;&quot;92bd1c3d2a11fc4aba2735d9547bd0261560fb20f36a0e7ca2f2d451f1b62690&quot; ;&quot;a3efbc07068606ba1c19a7ef21f4de15d15b41ef680832d7bcba485143668f2d&quot; ;&quot;a25cadd48d70f6ea0c4a241d99c5241269e6faccb4054e62d16784640f8e53bc&quot; ;&quot;d3c6785e18fba3749fb785bc313cf8346182f532c59172b69adfb31b96a5d0af&quot; ) OR md5 of it = &quot;b91ce2fa41029f6955bff20079468448&quot; ) of native file (it as string)  then concatenation &quot;|&quot; of (pathname of it; size of it as string; modification time of it as string; version of it as string | &quot;version not detected&quot;; md5 of it | &quot;md5 not detected&quot;; sha1 of it | &quot;sha1 not detected&quot;;sha256 of it | &quot;sha256 not detected&quot;) of native file (it)  else (if it contains &quot;app_web_logoimagehandler.ashx.b6031896.dll&quot; and  (sha256 of it is contained by set of (&quot;c15abaf51e78ca56c0376522d699c978217bf041a3bd3c71d09193efa5717c71&quot;)) of native file (it as string)  then concatenation &quot;|&quot; of (pathname of it; size of it as string; modification time of it as string; version of it as string | &quot;version not detected&quot;; md5 of it | &quot;md5 not detected&quot;; sha1 of it | &quot;sha1 not detected&quot;;sha256 of it | &quot;sha256 not detected&quot;) of native file (it)  else nothing))   ) of (if exists property &quot;locked lines&quot; then locked lines of it else lines of it) whose (it does not start with &quot;SCAN_COMPLETED&quot;) of files &quot;BPS-Scans\ED21-01\file_listing.txt&quot; of storage folder of client</Property>
    <Property ID="5" Name="ED-21-01 - All Target File Details" EvaluationPeriod="PT12H">(concatenation &quot;|&quot; of (pathname of it; size of it as string; modification time of it as string; version of it as string | &quot;version not detected&quot;; md5 of it | &quot;md5 not detected&quot;; sha1 of it | &quot;sha1 not detected&quot;; sha256 of it | &quot;sha256 not detected&quot;)) of ((if it as lowercase contains &quot;netsetupsvc.dll&quot; then files &quot;netsetupsvc.dll&quot; of system wow64 folder  else native files (it)   ) of  (if exists property &quot;locked lines&quot; then locked lines of it else lines of it) whose (it does not start with &quot;SCAN_COMPLETED&quot;) of files &quot;BPS-Scans\ED21-01\file_listing.txt&quot; of storage folder of client)</Property>
